# Build artifacts from `cd web && npm run build` — not committed. The
# .gitkeep sentinel (kept via emptyOutDir:false in vite.config.ts) is the
# only file tracked here so the //go:embed directive in pwa.go always finds
# at least one file. CI runs `go build` without first running
# `npm run build`, so the embedded PWA shell is whatever was built locally
# and committed (typically nothing — the build runs in CI's separate web
# job and is deployed alongside the binary, not embedded from this dir at
# CI time).
*
!.gitkeep
!.gitignore
